 :regrades
 [{:token :显式退出承诺 :v1 :partial :v2 :hungry
   :why "v1 以 parked_on 的 terminal-state? 为「显式退出」。读 parked_on.clj:273-319：terminal 指所等的作业终止，不是承诺方的退出；join 完成即 release、随即 drop-record 删除；预算耗尽者「retract silently」（273-285 行 docstring 原话）。这是令牌陈述的反面：静默终止、删除式终止。"
   :why-en "v1 cited parked_on's terminal-state? as an explicit exit. Read at parked_on.clj:273-319, 'terminal' means the awaited job finished, not that the promiser exited; a completed join is released and then deleted (drop-record), and an exhausted budget is 'retract[ed] silently' (the docstring's words). That is the opposite of the token: silent, deleting termination."}
  {:token :行权有据 :v1 :partial :v2 :hungry
   :why "v2 级联要求解读与效力分开；证据库给 Joe 的每条回合（含 42 条以他名义的提醒）打 claim-type :question（MAP Q2）。归因（--from）仍在，但陈述的后半「以他人名义的话不会让那人承担……」在运行中被违反。"
   :why-en "v2 requires interpretation and effect to be separate. The evidence store gives every turn under Joe's name, the 42 notices included, claim-type :question (MAP Q2). Attribution via --from is still there, but the second half of the token (words in someone's name do not bind them) is violated in the running system."}
  {:token :闸门响亮 :v1 :partial :v2 :partial
   :why "两个指针读过后都不支持所述：followup_queue.clj:14-32 是状态文件读写与去重；invariants.clj:22-52 是三个特性开关的汇总。已重指到 http.clj:5335-5350（跟进按 agent+session 精确入队）。满足度不变，依据换了。"
   :why-en "Neither v1 pointer supports the claim: followup_queue.clj:14-32 reads and writes a state file; invariants.clj:22-52 summarises three feature flags. Re-pointed to http.clj:5335-5350 (followups enqueued to an exact agent+session). Satiety unchanged, basis replaced."}
  {:token :投递回执 :v1 :partial :v2 :partial
   :why "v1 三个指针两处是注释、一处是开关函数；已重指到 handle-bell 与它的 202 回执（http.clj:5550-5553、5636）。"
   :why-en "Two of v1's three pointers were comments and one a flag function. Re-pointed to handle-bell and its 202 receipt (http.clj:5550-5553, 5636)."}
  {:token :历史完备 :v1 :partial :v2 :partial
   :why "v1 的 http.clj:260 只是一个 atom 的定义、zai_api.clj:1496 是注释；已重指到 turn-commits 的实际写入（zai_api.clj:1568-1580）。"
   :why-en "v1's http.clj:260 is only an atom definition and zai_api.clj:1496 a comment. Re-pointed to the actual turn-commits write (zai_api.clj:1568-1580)."}
  {:token :行为类型 :v1 :partial :v2 :partial
   :why "指错一处：v1 以 futon1b_evidence.clj:66-67 为 :claim-type 词表，这两行是 in-reply-to。正确的位置是 futon1b_evidence.clj:41-45（claim-type 必填，否则拒绝）。已改指针。"
   :why-en "Wrong pointer: v1 cited futon1b_evidence.clj:66-67 as the :claim-type vocabulary; those lines are in-reply-to. The right place is futon1b_evidence.clj:41-45 (claim-type required, else refused)."}
  {:token :撤销类型 :v1 :partial :v2 :partial
   :why "v1 的 :missing 把「幂等 id 由 type+endpoints 稳定推出」写成优点。读 futon1b_server.clj:69-75：id 确由类型与端点拼成，同类同端点的两次行为会合成一条（codex 点 4）。retract 的语义本身有测试（:witnessed），但这句话移到 :行为定名 作为缺陷。另：test_temporal.clj:116-129 用的是显式 :hx/id，没有测到推出的 id。"
   :why-en "v1's :missing called 'idempotent ids derived from type+endpoints' a strength. Read at futon1b_server.clj:69-75: the id is type plus endpoints, so two acts of the same type between the same endpoints collapse into one (codex point 4). Retract itself is tested (:witnessed); the defect moves to :行为定名. Also: test_temporal.clj:116-129 passes an explicit :hx/id, so it never exercises the derived id."}]

